{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"da01000000000002","type":"group","x":640,"y":-1200,"width":3580,"height":1520,"color":"5","label":"角色分层 + 组件通信"},
		{"id":"da01000000000004","type":"group","x":960,"y":560,"width":3360,"height":520,"color":"2","label":"开始用车顺序（主流程）"},
		{"id":"da01000000000005","type":"group","x":960,"y":1160,"width":2640,"height":510,"color":"2","label":"恢复 / 停止顺序"},
		{"id":"da01000000000006","type":"group","x":-40,"y":1160,"width":920,"height":800,"color":"1","label":"改代码先看哪里"},
		{"id":"da01000000000003","type":"group","x":0,"y":360,"width":920,"height":620,"color":"6","label":"关键变量 / Storage 中文意思"},
		{"id":"da01000000000001","type":"group","x":-120,"y":-1200,"width":660,"height":640,"color":"4","label":"阅读入口"},
		{"id":"db0100000000000b","type":"text","text":"## 页面变量中文意思\n\n- `selectedVehicle`：当前车辆 / 当前审批单对应的车\n- `vehicleActive`：车辆定位是否已经正式激活\n- `vehicleApprovalStatus`：车辆审批状态\n- `vehicleSubmitting`：车辆流程提交锁\n- `scanLoading`：扫码打卡 loading","x":20,"y":400,"width":420,"height":240,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"db0100000000000d","type":"text","text":"## runtime 缓存\n\n`LOCATION_REPORTER_RUNTIME_STATE`\n\n中文意思：定位运行时状态缓存\n\n保存：\n- `entityId`\n- `type`\n- `active`\n\n它偏运行时恢复语义。","x":460,"y":400,"width":420,"height":240,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"db0100000000000c","type":"text","text":"## 页面业务缓存\n\n`attendanceVehicleState`\n\n中文意思：attendance 页面里的车辆业务状态缓存\n\n保存：\n- `selectedVehicle`\n- `vehicleActive`\n- `vehicleApprovalStatus`\n\n它偏业务语义。","x":20,"y":680,"width":420,"height":240,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"db0100000000000e","type":"text","text":"## reporter 缓存\n\n- `LOCATION_REPORT_LAST_SUCCESS_AT`\n  中文意思：最后一次成功上报时间\n- `LOCATION_REPORT_PENDING_PAYLOAD`\n  中文意思：待补发的失败定位数据\n\n它偏失败补偿，不负责页面回显。","x":460,"y":680,"width":420,"height":240,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"db01000000000003","type":"text","text":"## 子组件\n\n`AttendanceLocationSelector.vue`\n\n中文意思：车辆表单区块组件\n\n角色：\n- 收集 `formData`\n- 做局部校验\n- `emit('submitVehicle')`\n- `emit('closeVehicle')`\n\n它负责交互，不负责最终业务决策。","x":670,"y":-720,"width":240,"height":520,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"db01000000000004","type":"text","text":"## 父组件\n\n`attendance/index.vue`\n\n中文意思：页面业务入口 / 容器组件\n\n角色：\n- 处理审批\n- 启动 / 停止定位\n- 写 `attendanceVehicleState`\n- 通过 props 把状态回流给子组件","x":1370,"y":-680,"width":260,"height":480,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"db01000000000006","type":"text","text":"## App 层\n\n`App.vue`\n\n中文意思：应用级恢复入口\n\n角色：\n- 启动时恢复\n- 回前台时恢复\n\n注意：\n它只在“恢复流程”里参与，不是平时提交审批的主入口。","x":1370,"y":-160,"width":260,"height":360,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"db01000000000007","type":"text","text":"## store 层\n\n`accountStore`\n\n中文意思：共享状态协调层\n\n角色：\n- 登录后同步后端车辆状态\n- 决定是否继续恢复定位\n- 退出登录时统一停止定位","x":2110,"y":-80,"width":260,"height":290,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"db01000000000008","type":"text","text":"## runtime 层\n\n`locationReporterRuntime.js`\n\n中文意思：定位运行时桥接层\n\n关键函数：\n- `setLocationReporterEntityId`\n- `startLocationReporter`\n- `stopLocationReporter`\n- `shouldResumeLocationReporter`","x":3000,"y":-1040,"width":260,"height":380,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"db01000000000009","type":"text","text":"## reporter 层\n\n`locationReporter.js`\n\n中文意思：底层定位上报引擎\n\n关键函数：\n- `flushPendingPayload`\n- `submitPayload`\n\n它负责真正定位、上报、失败补偿。","x":3690,"y":-1040,"width":260,"height":340,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"db0100000000000a","type":"text","text":"## 最重要一句\n\n平时主链：\n子组件 -> 父组件 -> runtime -> reporter\n\n恢复主链：\nApp -> store -> runtime -> reporter","x":3200,"y":-420,"width":490,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"db01000000000005","type":"text","text":"## 父子通信\n\n父 -> 子：`props`\n- `selectedVehicle`\n- `vehicleActive`\n- `approvalStatus`\n- `submitting`\n- `personalName`\n- `isTempWorker`\n\n子 -> 父：`emit`\n- `submitVehicle`\n- `closeVehicle`","x":2110,"y":-560,"width":300,"height":400,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"db01000000000015","type":"text","text":"A. 页面自己恢复\n\n函数：`restoreAndResumeVehicleState`\n\n中文意思：\nattendance 页面回来时，先读 `attendanceVehicleState`，看要不要继续跑审批/定位。","x":980,"y":1220,"width":240,"height":340,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"db01000000000016","type":"text","text":"B. App 级恢复\n\n函数：`resumeVehicleState`\n\n中文意思：\n小程序启动/回前台时，先问 runtime 还能不能直接恢复。","x":1530,"y":1220,"width":240,"height":340,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"db01000000000017","type":"text","text":"C. store 登录后同步\n\n函数：\n- `syncVehicleUsageFormFromLoginInfo`\n- `resumeVehicleLocation`\n\n中文意思：\n用后端登录态纠正本地缓存，再决定是否继续定位。","x":2070,"y":1220,"width":240,"height":340,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"db01000000000018","type":"text","text":"D. 结束用车\n\n函数：\n- `handleCloseVehicle`\n- `stopLocationReporter`\n\n中文意思：\n先停 runtime，再清页面业务状态。","x":2600,"y":1220,"width":240,"height":340,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"db01000000000019","type":"text","text":"E. reporter 补偿恢复\n\n变量：`LOCATION_REPORT_PENDING_PAYLOAD`\n\n中文意思：\n就算页面结束了，失败待补发数据也可能还在，下次 reporter 会继续补报。","x":3160,"y":1220,"width":300,"height":340,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"db01000000000010","type":"text","text":"2. 父组件创建审批单\n\n函数：`handleSubmitVehicle`\n\n中文意思：\n父组件接住子组件动作，调用 `apiModifyCarStatus`，并先把 `attendanceVehicleState` 写成“审批中”。","x":1390,"y":615,"width":240,"height":345,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"db01000000000011","type":"text","text":"3. 父组件轮询审批\n\n函数：`waitVehicleApproved`\n\n中文意思：\n不停查 `apiCheckApproval`，直到审批通过。\n\n状态仍主要由父组件持有。","x":1790,"y":580,"width":240,"height":345,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"db01000000000012","type":"text","text":"4. runtime 设置目标\n\n函数：\n- `setLocationReporterEntityId`\n- `startLocationReporter`\n\n中文意思：\n先告诉系统“要追踪哪辆车”，再正式启动定位。","x":2250,"y":580,"width":240,"height":345,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"db0100000000000f","type":"text","text":"1. 子组件收集表单\n\n函数/变量：\n- `formData`\n- `emit('submitVehicle')`\n\n中文意思：\n先在表单区收集车牌、类型、金额，再把“提交用车”动作交给父组件。","x":990,"y":615,"width":240,"height":345,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"db01000000000013","type":"text","text":"5. reporter 真正上报\n\n函数：\n- `flushPendingPayload`\n- `submitPayload`\n\n中文意思：\n先补发旧失败数据，再上报当前新定位。","x":2780,"y":580,"width":240,"height":345,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"db01000000000014","type":"text","text":"6. 页面状态回流到子组件\n\n中文意思：\n父组件在定位启动成功后，把\n- `vehicleApprovalStatus = 已执行`\n- `vehicleActive = true`\n写回 `attendanceVehicleState`，再通过 props 回给子组件。\n\n这一步决定按钮、文案、回显怎么变。","x":3360,"y":580,"width":500,"height":345,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"db0100000000001c","type":"text","text":"## 想改重进小程序后的恢复\n\n先看：\n- `App.vue`\n- `accountStore.resumeVehicleLocation`\n- `shouldResumeLocationReporter`","x":420,"y":1200,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"db0100000000001d","type":"text","text":"## 想改后台定位 / 上报 / 重试\n\n先看：\n- `locationReporterRuntime.js`\n- 再看 `locationReporter.js`\n\n原则：先改 runtime 控制，再改 reporter 引擎。","x":420,"y":1540,"width":400,"height":260,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"db0100000000001a","type":"text","text":"## 想改表单 / 按钮 / 回显\n\n先看：\n- `AttendanceLocationSelector.vue`\n- 再看父组件 props 怎么传","x":-20,"y":1200,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"db0100000000001b","type":"text","text":"## 想改审批通过后做什么\n\n先看：\n- `attendance/index.vue`\n- 重点找：`handleSubmitVehicle`\n- `waitVehicleApproved`\n- `applyLocationTarget`","x":-20,"y":1540,"width":400,"height":260,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"db01000000000001","type":"file","file":"travelKnowledge/我的整理/Enhance Skill 整理/location/attendance enhance analysis.md","x":-100,"y":-1180,"width":620,"height":280},
		{"id":"db01000000000002","type":"text","text":"# 读图顺序\n\n1. 先看“父子组件 + store/service”怎么分层。\n2. 再看关键变量和 Storage 的中文意思。\n3. 再按时间顺序看“开始用车”和“恢复/停止”。\n4. 最后看“改代码先看哪里”。","x":-100,"y":-860,"width":620,"height":260,"color":"4"}
	],
	"edges":[
